Javascript
- It is a synchronous => means code wil execute one by one by default
- It is a single threaded language means it will execute in a single thread and slow compare with other language by default

Execution Context
- It execute one line of code at a time
- Each operation will wait for the last one until it is completed to execute

Blocking Code
- Block the flow of program 

Non Blocking code
- Does not block the code